1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,470
Papa ki FD har saal badh rahi thi,

2
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:06,506
phir bhi Papa gareeb ho rahe the.

3
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:09,976
Almirah mein receipts ki ek moti file hai.

4
00:00:09,976 --> 00:00:12,578
Har receipt par byaaj likha hai.

5
00:00:12,578 --> 00:00:17,349
Papa use pyaar se chhoo kar kehte hain, beta, safe hai,

6
00:00:17,349 --> 00:00:18,650
kahin nahi jaayega.

7
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:22,847
Ek shaam Mummy sabzi ka thaila lekar ghar aayi.

8
00:00:22,847 --> 00:00:27,509
Thaila halka tha, par bill bhaari tha. Mummy ne kaha,

9
00:00:27,509 --> 00:00:32,172
pehle isi paise mein poora hafta aaraam se chalta tha.

10
00:00:32,172 --> 00:00:36,835
Ab beech hafte mein hi khatam. Papa ne chashma utaara,

11
00:00:36,835 --> 00:00:38,700
aur chup ho gaye.

12
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:42,683
Papa ka hisaab bilkul seedha tha. Paisa bank mein hai,

13
00:00:42,683 --> 00:00:46,666
har saal byaaj judta hai, toh total badh raha hai.

14
00:00:46,666 --> 00:00:49,056
Receipt par number bada hota gaya.

15
00:00:49,056 --> 00:00:52,242
Par dukaan par wahi number chhota padta gaya.

16
00:00:52,242 --> 00:00:55,030
Yahi is kahani ka chhupa chor hai.

17
00:00:55,030 --> 00:00:59,432
Toh aaj teen sawaal. Pehla, FD par byaaj milta hai,

18
00:00:59,432 --> 00:01:02,514
phir bhi paisa kam kaise hua? Doosra,

19
00:01:02,514 --> 00:01:07,357
FD ke byaaj par tax kab aur kitna kat-ta hai? Teesra,

20
00:01:07,357 --> 00:01:09,558
emergency ka paisa kahan rakhein?

21
00:01:09,558 --> 00:01:13,520
Teeno ka jawaab isi ghar ki kahani mein hai.

22
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:18,364
Pehla sawaal. Byaaj mila, phir bhi paisa kam kaise hua?

23
00:01:18,364 --> 00:01:22,238
Iske liye ek shabd samajhna zaroori hai, mehngai.

24
00:01:22,238 --> 00:01:26,598
Mehngai yaani cheezon ke daam ka dheere dheere badhna.

25
00:01:26,598 --> 00:01:29,504
Aaj jo thali aap khareedte ho,

26
00:01:29,504 --> 00:01:32,410
agle saal wahi thali mehngi milegi.

27
00:01:32,410 --> 00:01:34,706
Ab FD ka byaaj dekhiye.

28
00:01:34,706 --> 00:01:41,136
July 2026 mein banks ne naye FD par average lagbhag 5.9 percent byaaj diya.

29
00:01:41,136 --> 00:01:44,811
Yeh baat Grip Invest ki report mein hai.

30
00:01:44,811 --> 00:01:48,944
Sunne mein achha lagta hai. Paisa badh raha hai,

31
00:01:48,944 --> 00:01:51,700
toh sab theek hai, hai na?

32
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:56,121
Par asli sawaal yeh hai. Aapka paisa kitna badha,

33
00:01:56,121 --> 00:01:59,560
aur aapke kharche kitne badhe? Agar doodh,

34
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:04,472
dawai aur school fees ka kharcha byaaj se tez badhe,

35
00:02:04,472 --> 00:02:07,420
toh receipt par number bada hai,

36
00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:11,350
par aapki khareedne ki taakat chhoti ho gayi.

37
00:02:11,350 --> 00:02:14,027
Isi ko kehte hain real return.

38
00:02:14,027 --> 00:02:19,826
Real return yaani byaaj mein se mehngai kaat kar jo sach mein bacha.

39
00:02:19,826 --> 00:02:22,949
Agar mehngai 5.9 percent se kam hai,

40
00:02:22,949 --> 00:02:26,517
toh aap thoda aage ho. Agar zyada hai,

41
00:02:26,517 --> 00:02:29,640
toh aap chupchaap peeche ja rahe ho.

42
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:33,786
Ek din Beta ne apni gullak ke sikke gine.

43
00:02:33,786 --> 00:02:37,933
Dadaji yaani Papa ne kaha, inhe mat kharcho, bachao.

44
00:02:37,933 --> 00:02:39,775
Beta ne poocha, Dadaji,

45
00:02:39,775 --> 00:02:43,922
jo toffee pichle saal in sikkon mein aati thi,

46
00:02:43,922 --> 00:02:47,147
ab kyun nahi aati? Papa has diye,

47
00:02:47,147 --> 00:02:49,450
par sawaal bilkul sahi tha.

48
00:02:49,450 --> 00:02:53,395
Mehngai ek chhupa tax hai. Koi form nahi bharta,

49
00:02:53,395 --> 00:02:55,149
koi notice nahi aata.

50
00:02:55,149 --> 00:02:59,971
Bas har saal aapke rupaye ki keemat thodi ghat jaati hai.

51
00:02:59,971 --> 00:03:04,355
FD ka byaaj agar is chor se tez nahi bhaagta,

52
00:03:04,355 --> 00:03:08,300
toh paisa safe dikhta hai, par ghat-ta rehta hai.

53
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:12,950
Papa ki file mein yeh baat kabhi likhi hi nahi thi.

54
00:03:12,950 --> 00:03:16,331
Receipt sirf byaaj batati hai, mehngai nahi batati.

55
00:03:16,331 --> 00:03:19,712
Isliye Papa ko laga sab badh raha hai.

56
00:03:19,712 --> 00:03:25,630
Asal mein unki FD bas apni jagah khadi rehne ke liye daud rahi thi.

57
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:29,781
Doosra sawaal, aur yahan ek aur chhupa kharcha hai.

58
00:03:29,781 --> 00:03:32,548
FD ka byaaj free nahi hota.

59
00:03:32,548 --> 00:03:35,315
Woh aapki income mein judta hai.

60
00:03:35,315 --> 00:03:40,388
Aur income par tax lagta hai, aapke slab ke hisaab se.

61
00:03:40,388 --> 00:03:45,000
Slab yaani income ki seedhi, jitni oonchi, utna zyada tax.

62
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:50,822
Behen office se aayi aur phone par FD ki statement kholi.

63
00:03:50,822 --> 00:03:55,585
Byaaj credit hua tha, par poora nahi. Usne poocha,

64
00:03:55,585 --> 00:03:59,290
yeh kam kyun aaya? Jawaab tha TDS.

65
00:03:59,290 --> 00:04:06,170
TDS yaani bank khud aapka tax kaat kar sarkar ko bhej deta hai.

66
00:04:06,170 --> 00:04:11,596
Behen ko laga yahi poora tax hai. Par aisa zaroori nahi.

67
00:04:11,596 --> 00:04:14,555
TDS sirf ek advance katauti hai.

68
00:04:14,555 --> 00:04:18,501
Aakhri hisaab income tax return mein hota hai.

69
00:04:18,501 --> 00:04:20,967
Agar aapka slab ooncha hai,

70
00:04:20,967 --> 00:04:25,900
toh return bharte waqt aur tax dena pad sakta hai.

71
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:28,272
Ab sabse oonche slab ki sochiye.

72
00:04:28,272 --> 00:04:32,621
New regime mein sabse oonche slab par 30 percent tax hai.

73
00:04:32,621 --> 00:04:36,575
Matlab FD ke byaaj ka 30 percent sarkar ke paas.

74
00:04:36,575 --> 00:04:40,133
Jo byaaj pehle hi mehngai se lad raha tha,

75
00:04:40,133 --> 00:04:42,110
woh aur patla ho gaya.

76
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:45,907
Toh FD ka asli hisaab yeh bana. Pehle tax katega,

77
00:04:45,907 --> 00:04:47,806
phir mehngai khaayegi. Jo bachega,

78
00:04:47,806 --> 00:04:50,844
wahi aapka sach mein kamaya hua paisa hai.

79
00:04:50,844 --> 00:04:56,160
Kai logon ke liye yeh bacha hua hissa umeed se kaafi chhota nikalta hai.

80
00:04:56,160 --> 00:05:00,702
Par har kisi par itna tax nahi lagta. Papa retired hain,

81
00:05:00,702 --> 00:05:02,353
unki income kam hai.

82
00:05:02,353 --> 00:05:06,069
New regime mein 12 lakh tak ki income par,

83
00:05:06,069 --> 00:05:08,960
rebate ke baad, tax zero banta hai.

84
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:11,850
Rebate yaani sarkar ki di hui chhoot.

85
00:05:11,850 --> 00:05:17,651
Matlab Papa jaise logon ke liye tax ka bojh halka ho sakta hai.

86
00:05:17,651 --> 00:05:21,668
Par mehngai ka chor phir bhi wahin khada hai.

87
00:05:21,668 --> 00:05:26,130
Tax na lage, toh bhi kharche toh badhte hi hain.

88
00:05:26,130 --> 00:05:29,700
Isliye sirf tax mat dekhiye, real return dekhiye.

89
00:05:29,700 --> 00:05:31,462
Aur ek kaam ki baat.

90
00:05:31,462 --> 00:05:33,929
Agar aapki income chhoot ke andar hai,

91
00:05:33,929 --> 00:05:36,044
par bank ne TDS kaat liya,

92
00:05:36,044 --> 00:05:39,568
toh woh paisa return bharne par wapas mil sakta hai.

93
00:05:39,568 --> 00:05:42,035
Bahut log yeh claim karte hi nahi.

94
00:05:42,035 --> 00:05:44,150
Unka paisa yunhi pada rehta hai.

95
00:05:44,150 --> 00:05:47,383
Teesra sawaal. Toh kya FD bekaar hai? Bilkul nahi.

96
00:05:47,383 --> 00:05:49,898
Har cheez ka ek kaam hota hai.

97
00:05:49,898 --> 00:05:52,053
FD ka kaam paisa badhana kam,

98
00:05:52,053 --> 00:05:54,208
paisa sambhaal kar rakhna zyada hai.

99
00:05:54,208 --> 00:05:58,160
Aur ek jagah yeh kaam FD bahut achhe se karti hai.

100
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:01,405
Ek raat Papa ko seene mein dard hua.

101
00:06:01,405 --> 00:06:05,056
Hospital mein pehla sawaal tha, deposit kitna jama karoge?

102
00:06:05,056 --> 00:06:09,519
Us waqt kisi lambi scheme ka intezaar nahi ho sakta tha.

103
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:13,170
Paisa usi raat chahiye tha, bina kisi deri ke.

104
00:06:13,170 --> 00:06:15,765
Isi ko kehte hain emergency fund.

105
00:06:15,765 --> 00:06:21,386
Emergency fund yaani woh paisa jo sirf mushkil waqt ke liye rakha ho.

106
00:06:21,386 --> 00:06:23,549
Naukri chhoot jaaye, beemari aaye,

107
00:06:23,549 --> 00:06:26,576
ya ghar mein achanak kharcha aa jaaye.

108
00:06:26,576 --> 00:06:30,900
Is paise ka kaam kamaana nahi, waqt par milna hai.

109
00:06:30,900 --> 00:06:34,750
Yahan FD ya savings account kaam aata hai.

110
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:39,080
Paisa jaldi nikalta hai, daam upar neeche nahi hote.

111
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:41,005
Mehngai thoda khaayegi, maana.

112
00:06:41,005 --> 00:06:48,223
Par emergency mein turant paisa milne ki keemat us thode nuksaan se kahin zyada hai.

113
00:06:48,223 --> 00:06:51,110
Raat ko neend bhi aati hai.

114
00:06:51,110 --> 00:06:54,078
Aur agar bank hi doob jaaye toh?

115
00:06:54,078 --> 00:06:56,623
Yahan DICGC ka naam aata hai.

116
00:06:56,623 --> 00:07:00,439
DICGC yaani bank deposits ka insurance dene wali sanstha.

117
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:03,408
Har depositor ke liye, har bank mein,

118
00:07:03,408 --> 00:07:06,800
5 lakh rupaye tak ka cover milta hai.

119
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:11,095
Isliye Wife ne ghar ka ek simple niyam banaya.

120
00:07:11,095 --> 00:07:14,912
Poora emergency paisa ek hi bank mein nahi,

121
00:07:14,912 --> 00:07:18,252
zaroorat ho toh alag alag banks mein.

122
00:07:18,252 --> 00:07:22,070
Taaki har jagah paisa cover ke andar rahe.

123
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:25,410
Yeh dar nahi hai, bas samajhdaari hai.

124
00:07:25,410 --> 00:07:28,652
FD chhote goals ke liye bhi theek baithti hai.

125
00:07:28,652 --> 00:07:30,454
Agle saal bachche ki fees,

126
00:07:30,454 --> 00:07:34,417
ya kuch mahine baad shaadi ka kharcha. Jab paisa jaldi chahiye,

127
00:07:34,417 --> 00:07:38,740
toh upar neeche hone wali jagah ka risk lena samajhdaari nahi hai.

128
00:07:38,740 --> 00:07:41,829
Ab woh galti jo Papa ne ki,

129
00:07:41,829 --> 00:07:46,242
aur bahut log karte hain. Galti FD lena nahi thi.

130
00:07:46,242 --> 00:07:47,124
Galti thi,

131
00:07:47,124 --> 00:07:51,537
saari zindagi ki bachat saalon saal sirf FD mein rakhna.

132
00:07:51,537 --> 00:07:55,950
Lambe samay ke paise ko bhi emergency jaisa treat karna.

133
00:07:55,950 --> 00:08:00,163
Lambe samay mein mehngai har saal thoda kaatti hai.

134
00:08:00,163 --> 00:08:02,035
Upar se tax bhi.

135
00:08:02,035 --> 00:08:06,247
Saal dar saal yeh chhoti katauti judti jaati hai.

136
00:08:06,247 --> 00:08:11,396
Aur ek din Mummy poochti hain, paisa kahan gaya? Jawaab hai,

137
00:08:11,396 --> 00:08:12,800
chupchaap, dheere dheere.

138
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,729
Toh kya karein? Pehla kadam,

139
00:08:14,729 --> 00:08:17,816
apni bachat ko kaam ke hisaab se baantiye.

140
00:08:17,816 --> 00:08:20,902
Kuch paisa turant chahiye, kuch paisa saalon baad.

141
00:08:20,902 --> 00:08:23,217
Dono ko ek hi jagah rakhna,

142
00:08:23,217 --> 00:08:26,690
ek hi chaabi se har taala kholne jaisa hai.

143
00:08:26,690 --> 00:08:32,149
Doosra kadam, har saal apna real return khud nikaaliye. Byaaj dekhiye,

144
00:08:32,149 --> 00:08:37,112
tax ghataiye, aur ghar ke kharche kitne badhe, yeh sochiye.

145
00:08:37,112 --> 00:08:40,586
Agar bacha hua hissa bahut chhota hai,

146
00:08:40,586 --> 00:08:44,060
toh kam se kam sawaal zaroor poochiye.

147
00:08:44,060 --> 00:08:49,735
Teesra kadam, lambe goals ke liye doosre raaste samajhiye. Jaise PPF,

148
00:08:49,735 --> 00:08:55,927
jo sarkari scheme hai aur abhi 7.1 percent saalana byaaj deti hai.

149
00:08:55,927 --> 00:09:01,086
Har option ka lock-in, risk aur tax alag hota hai.

150
00:09:01,086 --> 00:09:03,150
Pehle samjho, phir socho.

151
00:09:03,150 --> 00:09:04,990
Yeh investment advice nahi hai.

152
00:09:04,990 --> 00:09:07,935
Kahin bhi paisa lagane se pehle apni zaroorat,

153
00:09:07,935 --> 00:09:09,407
umar aur risk dekhiye.

154
00:09:09,407 --> 00:09:12,719
Zaroorat ho toh kisi qualified advisor se baat kariye.

155
00:09:12,719 --> 00:09:18,240
Maqsad sirf itna hai ki aap receipt ke number ke peeche ka sach dekh sako.

156
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:21,426
Us raat Papa ne file kholi,

157
00:09:21,426 --> 00:09:26,737
aur pehli baar receipt ke saath sabzi ka bill rakha.

158
00:09:26,737 --> 00:09:32,579
Dono ko dekha, aur dheere se bole, safe hona aur badhna,

159
00:09:32,579 --> 00:09:37,890
alag cheezein hain. Mujhe yeh pehle kisi ne nahi bataya.

160
00:09:37,890 --> 00:09:39,972
Ab aapse ek aasaan sawaal.

161
00:09:39,972 --> 00:09:43,719
Aapke ghar ki sabse zyada bachat kahan rakhi hai,

162
00:09:43,719 --> 00:09:48,298
FD mein ya kahin aur? Ek shabd mein comment mein likhiye.

163
00:09:48,298 --> 00:09:50,380
Main har jawaab padhta hoon.

164
00:09:50,380 --> 00:09:54,928
Agli video mein ek aur ghar ki kahani. Sona,

165
00:09:54,928 --> 00:10:00,993
jo har maa ki almirah mein kahin na kahin rakha hota hai.

166
00:10:00,993 --> 00:10:05,036
Kya woh sach mein mehngai se bachata hai,

167
00:10:05,036 --> 00:10:08,573
ya woh bhi ek meethi galatfehmi hai?

168
00:10:08,573 --> 00:10:11,100
Milte hain agli kahani mein.
